    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two health points and double jump, that\u00b4s all you need!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elfscape: Ancestors you control a Temple Guardian, with movement as swift as a ninja! You will have to overcome sophisticated moving obstacles.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/9ab3ca3a3749cd5c313b80c876880239.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/9ab3ca3a3749cd5c313b80c876880239.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/9ab3ca3a3749cd5c313b80c876880239.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might die a lot, but that\u2019s the rough life in the Underworld. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Story of the Guardian</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Guardian has been asleep for a long time, resting in the Temple, and waiting for the Chosen One\u2019s arrival. Now the time has come to wake up, time to fulfill the prophecy and fight by his side.  But the Chosen One is nowhere in sight, and nobody speaks a language she can understand. What\u00b4s going on?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/ed6056df4e4130964a5be039e7de46e9.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/ed6056df4e4130964a5be039e7de46e9.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/ed6056df4e4130964a5be039e7de46e9.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Two adventures in one</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>During your explorations, you\u2019ll occasionally encounter a headless statues of Lahmu - the God of the Underworld. Reunite the statues with their lost heads to receive comics pages. These pages tell the story of two local hunters, Jachan and Agol, on their adventure outside the Temple city\u00b4s safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=500 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The changing city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to get along with people you can't understand. The townspeople react to the progress of the game\u00b4s story in unexpected ways. However, spending your coins on cultivating the city will make the townspeople grateful and you'll help them to make the Temple city more beautiful. Of course, you can always choose to spend your coins on a stylish new skin for yourself. The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/377010ce2c5301c068517e5a59c65ac5.avif?t=1746824843\" width=194 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported using public funding by Slovak Arts Council</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
