eamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/ed6056df4e4130964a5be039e7de46e9.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><br>Two adventures in one</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>During your explorations, you\u2019ll occasionally encounter a headless statues of Lahmu - the God of the Underworld. Reunite the statues with their lost heads to receive comics pages. These pages tell the story of two local hunters, Jachan and Agol, on their adventure outside the Temple city\u00b4s safety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=500 height=526 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/c4d7b0479cf5ee65abf2a6d4dec52025.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The changing city</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's hard to get along with people you can't understand. The townspeople react to the progress of the game\u00b4s story in unexpected ways. However, spending your coins on cultivating the city will make the townspeople grateful and you'll help them to make the Temple city more beautiful. Of course, you can always choose to spend your coins on a stylish new skin for yourself. The choice is yours! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.poster.avif?t=1746824843\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.webm?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/8d1cead67409410ad33723f433f8fee3.mp4?t=1746824843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2827970/extras/377010ce2c5301c068517e5a59c65ac5.avif?t=1746824843\" width=194 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported using public funding by Slovak Arts Council</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
